From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SystoleOS <systole@example.org>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 16:30:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] COMP: Add missing <iostream> includes for VTK 9.6

VTK 9.6 headers no longer include <iostream> transitively, nor provide
the global using-declarations for cout/cerr/clog, so code written
against older VTK fails with "'cerr' is not a member of 'std'" or
"'cerr' was not declared in this scope".  Include <iostream> in every
source file that uses these streams and qualify bare uses with std::.
---
 IGSIOCommon/Testing/AccurateTimerTest.cxx                | 1 +
 IGSIOCommon/Testing/igsioCommonTest.cxx                  | 1 +
 IGSIOCommon/Testing/igsioMathTest.cxx                    | 1 +
 IGSIOCommon/Testing/vtkIGSIOLoggerTest.cxx               | 1 +
 IGSIOCommon/Testing/vtkTransformRepositoryTest.cxx       | 1 +
 IGSIOCommon/vtkIGSIOLogger.cxx                           | 1 +
 SequenceIO/Testing/vtkMetaImageSequenceIOTest.cxx        | 1 +
 SequenceIO/Testing/vtkMkvSequenceIOTest.cxx              | 1 +
 SequenceIO/vtkIGSIOMetaImageSequenceIO.cxx               | 2 +-
 VolumeReconstruction/Testing/VolumeReconstructorTest.cxx | 1 +
 VolumeReconstruction/vtkIGSIOVolumeReconstructor.cxx     | 3 ++-
 11 files changed, 12 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

